Fluid Motion includes or downloads third-party components:

- RIFE (Real-Time Intermediate Flow Estimation)
  https://github.com/hzwer/Practical-RIFE
  Used as ONNX model files (RIFE 4.6) via vs-mlrt.

- vs-mlrt (VapourSynth Machine Learning Runtime)
  https://github.com/AmusementClub/vs-mlrt
  TensorRT / CUDA backend for realtime interpolation.

- mpv
  https://mpv.io
  Not bundled. Must be installed separately, preferably a build with VapourSynth.

- VapourSynth
  https://www.vapoursynth.com
  Not bundled; often already present in portable mpv packages.

- NVIDIA TensorRT and CUDA runtime
  Downloaded on first-run setup from vs-mlrt releases.
  Subject to NVIDIA's own licenses. Not covered by this project's MIT license.
